### 2. The 5 Fixes Implemented

| # | Fix | What Was Done |
|---|-----|---------------|
| 1 | **Chord mode dropdown updates subdivided slots** | When appending a new sub to existing subs array, `entry.chord_mode_index` is set from `prefs.GetChordModeIndex()` before `table.insert` |
| 2 | **Right-click deletes only last sub** | Checks `slot.subs` and `#subs > 0`, uses `table.remove(entry.subs)`. Falls through to `progression.Remove` only when last sub remains |
| 3 | **Red circle with X to clear all subs** | `GetClearSubsRect` helper draws red circle (r=10, 0.7 alpha) with white X at bottom-right of subdivided slots. Euclidean hit-test in right-click block |
| 4 | **Slot number visibility** | Opacity 0.3→0.7, font size h*0.15→h*0.2, color text_dim→text |
| 5 | **Mouse wheel cycles sub-pads** | `slot_hover_idx`/`slot_hover_sub` in sequencer store. `ConsumeMouseWheelDelta` with wrap-around cycling. Hover preview in `DrawSlotLabel`, preview-aware click-to-play, dot highlighting, reset on mouse leave |

