### 3. Edge Cases Covered

- **Empty subdivision** (1/1): no subs, wheel does nothing
- **Single sub remaining**: right-click removes entire slot
- **Clear circle vs sub removal**: Euclidean distance check, circle hit-tested first
- **Wheel during drag**: wheel only processed when hover is true
- **Preview reset**: automatically clears when mouse leaves slot bounds

